01:46:00.510 --> 01:46:01.763
No, I'm just kidding.

01:46:01.763 --> 01:46:03.780
I mean, what was going through your mind?

01:46:03.780 --> 01:46:06.180
The human lifetime is finite.

01:46:06.180 --> 01:46:07.013
